@host = http://localhost:5080

### One order, normal LINQ. On a fresh Development database, order 1 belongs to Ava Patel.
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1/normal

### The same order through the compiled query. The JSON should match the normal call.
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1/compiled

### Missing order.
GET {{host}}/api/orders/999999/normal

### Orders for customer 1, normal LINQ.
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1/orders/normal

### Orders for customer 1, async compiled query.
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1/orders/compiled

### What the benchmark measures. This response does not contain timing numbers.
GET {{host}}/api/benchmark-info

### Swagger UI
GET {{host}}/swagger/index.html
